&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
A fast, responsive experience across all devices.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


  Lessons I Learned
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


  1. Your portfolio is a product
